              "text": "pignus, pignoris — \"a pledge, a security\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ānulum prō pignore dedit. He gave a ring as a pledge."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "pignus, pignoris n. A thing handed over as security for a debt, and any pledge of love or loyalty."
            }
          ]
        },
